    "quote": "There is an algorithm for \\matroidbanditexact, that returns the optimal basis for $\\matband$, with probability at least $1-\\delta$, and uses at most $$O\\left(\\sum_{e \\in S} \\Delta_{e}^{-2}(\\ln \\delta^{-1}+\\ln k + \\ln\\ln \\Delta_e^{-1}) \\right)$$ samples. Here, $k = \\rank(\\matroid)$ is the size of a basis of $\\matroid$."
